9\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 59\">59</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_60\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 60\">60</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_61\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 61\">61</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_62\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 62\">62</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_63\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 63\">63</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_64\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 64\">64</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_65\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 65\">65</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_66\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 66\">66</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_67\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 67\">67</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_68\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 68\">68</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_69\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 69\">69</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_70\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 70\">70</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_71\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 71\">71</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_72\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 72\">72</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_73\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 73\">73</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_74\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 74\">74</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_75\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 75\">75</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_76\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 76\">76</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_77\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 77\">77</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_78\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 78\">78</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_79\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 79\">79</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_80\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 80\">80</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_81\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 81\">81</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_82\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 82\">82</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_83\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 83\">83</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_84\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 84\">84</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_85\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 85\">85</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_86\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 86\">86</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_87\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 87\">87</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_88\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 88\">88</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_89\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 89\">89</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_90\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 90\">90</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_91\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 91\">91</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=200